    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑Attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A clear, self‑attested copy of the Registration Certificate (RC) confirms your ownership and provides the carrier with the vehicle’s exact make, model, and VIN. This document is required for all legal and insurance purposes.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current Pollution Under Control (PUC) Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A valid PUC certificate demonstrates that the vehicle meets environmental standards and is road‑worthy. Carriers often require this to avoid compliance issues at the point of departure.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Proof of a comprehensive insurance policy that covers mechanical breakdown, theft, and damage during transit. Premium carriers typically provide an additional layer of coverage, but your own policy should be up‑to‑date.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The International Bilty Authority (IBA) approved consignment bilty is the carrier’s official receipt and proof of shipment. It contains shipment details, pickup and delivery addresses, and the agreed terms of service.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>In addition to these documents, the hallmark of a truly premium service is the inclusion of <strong>100% declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong>. This insurance covers the full market value of the vehicle in the event of loss, theft, or damage during the marine portion of the journey.</p>
<p>By declaring the vehicle’s full value, you eliminate any potential under‑insurance gaps that could leave you with significant out‑of‑pocket expenses.</p>

<p>Why does this matter? Marine transit involves unique risks—saltwater corrosion, rough seas, and handling mishaps—that typical road‑only insurance may not fully cover.</p>
<p>A 100% declared‑value policy ensures that, regardless of the circumstances, you receive compensation equal to the vehicle’s true worth. This level of coverage transforms the cost of a premium enclosed carrier into a worthwhile investment, protecting your asset and giving you the confidence that your car will arrive safely and intact.</p>

<p>By submitting the self‑attested RC, current PUC, valid insurance certificate, and IBA‑approved consignment bilty, you not only meet the carrier’s requirements but also unlock the full suite of protections that make a premium enclosed carrier service worth every rupee.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


